  "bodyHash": "2dfb62885dea2788",
  "content": "<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hardcore-night-vision-goggles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">点击此处获取本模组的硬核版本！</span></em></span></strong></a></h6>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/basic-night-vision-goggles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>基础夜视镜！</strong></em></span></a></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">无限夜视功能</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.20.1 </strong><strong>需要&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API</a></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.21.1 需要 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorned\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Adorned (Curios)</a></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_33cb7fe7-a45b-4ac1-a089-a25c3d62d41c.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"199\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_02dd7518-5720-4fdf-b4c7-aaf7ca1f0abf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"161\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>最新更新！</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>版本 1.1.2</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">夜视镜可以放置在盔甲架上和地面上</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_fade80a2-9975-4f9a-be63-12f867a180d7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"229\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">右键点击夜视镜可设置特定旋转角度</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">手持任意夜视镜时，蹲下并右键点击可打开装备选项</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_6b385b68-337c-4eba-b5b9-3e9443f928d1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"241\" height=\"242\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_6e170233-0b98-4e78-a9b0-cda91641f24b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"241\" height=\"166\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>版本 1.1.1</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">为匹配颜色的夜视镜添加了颜色滤镜叠加层</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">滤镜是可选的，可以与夜视功能同时开启或关闭</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_1630352c-3f9a-4324-9772-be3fa439909a.gif\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400;text-align:center\"><strong>版本 1.1.0</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400;text-align:center\">&nbsp;添加了彩色夜视镜</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_e4b8e1ea-23f4-4a77-88af-32a7bab312cd.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">您可以更换颜色，无需重新合成新的夜视镜</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_034cfc64-9615-467b-9deb-017bc2a0ebc8.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"199\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">查看下方的更新日志以了解更多详情</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">示例图片</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8e9ea63b-ade5-422d-9655-04e24e461f6d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5743bfae-f9c3-40f0-9cae-3dfc421d4012.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b6f467e2-1a8c-4bdf-bbb5-365bf4995506.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9174c0df-7e87-4753-92fb-cb576afca1f3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_054206e1-4d9f-441b-8749-b61077ec536a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cbe58293-ae29-4409-b34e-ce3c862c9318.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c78c50c2-2095-48f3-b2ea-91620e1784cf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3b602255-e02b-4f46-9c6d-e0aef2aa5ffd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c34fa112-bc7f-494b-8f07-9bca56c0e418.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7e022106-3f57-424c-adb7-fd33d5aa9295.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_5340add8-42b9-4b0d-98c9-684f043932a5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"191\"></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">更新日志</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>1.0.1</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>&bull; 在游戏内模组菜单中添加了模组描述&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 为 1.20.1 模组添加了 neoforge 标签&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>1.0.2</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&bull; 修复了蹲下、游泳和飞行时夜视镜位置不正确的问题</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>1.1.0</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>&bull; 新增了 7 种颜色</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 添加了更换夜视镜颜色的合成配方</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>1.1.1</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>&bull; 修复了动画期间模型未跟随玩家头部旋转的问题</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 修复了模型不一致问题</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 鼻子镂空部分仅存在于 Java 模型中</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 将夜视镜名称的颜色更改为与镜片颜色相匹配</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 添加了颜色叠加层&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 视觉色调以模仿现实生活中的夜视镜外观</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 每个夜视镜都有与其镜片颜色匹配的独特颜色色调&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 添加了“夜视镜”按键绑定类别</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 将“夜视镜”按键绑定更改为“夜视”</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 添加了颜色叠加层（色调）的按键绑定</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 添加了夜视与叠加层（色调）的组合按键绑定</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 添加了装备夜视镜时显示颜色叠加层的按键绑定</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 按下时会在快捷栏上方显示 true 或 false</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 默认为 false</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 骷髅现在有 1% 的几率生成时佩戴夜视镜</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 佩戴夜视镜的骷髅死亡时可以掉落它们</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>1.1.2</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>&bull; 夜视镜现在可以作为方块一样放置在地面上</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 放置在地面上的夜视镜是实体，允许任意角度的旋转&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 放置夜视镜时，旋转方向取决于玩家的朝向&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 添加了旋转 GUI 以设置特定的护目镜旋转角度</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 右键点击已放置的护目镜可打开旋转 GUI</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 添加了在装备夜视镜时切换夜视功能和叠加层（色调）的 GUI</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 在主手持有任意夜视镜时，蹲下并右键点击以打开 GUI</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 移除了装备夜视镜时显示叠加层（色调）的按键绑定</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;-“装备时带色调”切换按钮现在位于 GUI 中</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 压缩了 logo.png 并删除了重复文件，使模组文件大小不再达到 2.5MB</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 夜视镜现在可以放置在盔甲架上（BETA 测试版）</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 避免点击盔甲架的头柱</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 如果点击盔甲架头柱，夜视镜会出现在盔甲架上，但仍保留在玩家手中</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 要正确装备，请点击盔甲架的身体部位</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 骷髅的掉落率现在为 33%（不受抢夺附魔影响）</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
